# What not to upload when deploying.
#
# Separate from .gitignore on purpose: Vercel did not honour it, and sent a
# 116 MB podcast episode from `audio/` — which is both pointless and over the
# 100 MB per-file limit, so the deploy failed outright.
#
# Everything here is either generated, enormous, or local-only. The build
# needs the workspace manifests and the TypeScript source, and nothing else.

node_modules
.git

# Built output. Vercel builds it itself; uploading ours would be stale.
.next
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage

# Real episodes, for local experiments. Hundreds of megabytes.
/audio

# The 825,000-pair lemma dictionary, loaded into Postgres by hand.
/packages/db/data

# Local only.
.env*.local
.vercel
.claude
CLAUDE.md

# Not needed to build or run.
/docs
